    <text type="letter">
        <body>
            <div type="writingSession">
                <pb n="1"/>
                <opener><fw place="top" type="letterhead">UNION THEOLOGICAL SEMINARY <lb/>BROADWAY
                        AT 120TH STREET <lb/><rs ref="#tillich_place_id__319" type="place">NEW
                            YORK</rs>
                        <!-- Adresszeile: Dr. Andor De Paal<lb/>Y M C A<lb/>1400 East 53<lb/>Chicago, Ill --></fw><dateline><date
                            when="1946-01-03">January 3, 1946</date></dateline>
                    <salute>Dear <rs ref="#tillich_person_id__3431" type="person">Mr. De
                        Paal</rs>:</salute></opener>
                <p>It is very nice of you to remember me and to send me your Season Greetings.<note
                        type="ea">Liegt nicht vor.</note> Of course my adress is still 99 Claremont
                    Avenue, <rs ref="#tillich_place_id__319" type="place">New York</rs> 27, <rs
                        ref="#tillich_place_id__865" type="place">N. Y.</rs>, and I am very eager to
                    hear from you and the news you intend to write me. </p>
                <closer><salute>With all my good wishes for a better 1946,</salute><signed>Yours <rs
                            ref="#tillich_person_id__1928" type="person">Prof. Paul
                        Tillich</rs></signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
